    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Thanksgiving and a Cry for Help"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director. A psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I waited patiently for the Lord,",
          "and he turned to me and heard my cry for help."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He brought me up from a desolate pit,",
          "out of the muddy clay,",
          "and set my feet on a rock,",
          "making my steps secure."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He put a new song in my mouth,",
          "a hymn of praise to our God.",
          "Many will see and fear,",
          "and they will trust in the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How happy is anyone",
          "who has put his trust in the Lord",
          "and has not turned to the proud",
          "or to those who run after lies!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord my God, you have done many things —",
          "your wondrous works and your plans for us;",
          "none can compare with you.",
          "If I were to report and speak of them,",
          "they are more than can be told."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You do not delight in sacrifice and offering;",
          "you open my ears to listen.",
          "You do not ask for a whole burnt offering or a sin offering."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then I said, “See, I have come;",
          "in the scroll it is written about me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I delight to do your will, my God,",
          "and your instruction is deep within me.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I proclaim righteousness in the great assembly;",
          "see, I do not keep my mouth closed —",
          "as you know, Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I did not hide your righteousness in my heart;",
          "I spoke about your faithfulness and salvation;",
          "I did not conceal your constant love and truth",
          "from the great assembly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, you do not withhold your compassion from me.",
          "Your constant love and truth will always guard me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For troubles without number have surrounded me;",
          "my iniquities have overtaken me; I am unable to see.",
          "They are more than the hairs of my head,",
          "and my courage leaves me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, be pleased to rescue me;",
          "hurry to help me, Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let those who intend to take my life",
          "be disgraced and confounded.",
          "Let those who wish me harm",
          "be turned back and humiliated."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let those who say to me, “Aha, aha! ”",
          "be appalled because of their shame."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let all who seek you rejoice and be glad in you;",
          "let those who love your salvation continually say,",
          "“The Lord is great! ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I am oppressed and needy;",
          "may the Lord think of me.",
          "You are my helper and my deliverer;",
          "my God, do not delay."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
